# --- Fake data ---------------------------------------------------------------
# The repo ships ONLY the generator (data/fake/generate.py) and a short README.
# Everything else under data/fake/ — raw sensor CSVs, ema.csv, Questions.json,
# enriched_*.jsonl, the narrative/qa/align_random/ift jsonl datasets, the Arrow
# intermediates, feature_rows, dataset_info.json, SEED — plus the example sample
# examples/one_sample_each.jsonl, is materialized deterministically (pinned seed
# in generate.py) by `make fake-data` and is NOT committed.
/data/fake/*
!/data/fake/generate.py
!/data/fake/README.md
/examples/one_sample_each.jsonl
*.arrow
*.backup

# Secrets — must never be committed
*.env
.env.local
config.local.yaml
secrets.yaml
